# Copy to .env at the repo root and fill in. Never commit the filled-in copy.
#
# Required for Phase 8 evaluation only. tau2's user simulator is a hosted model
# and speaks half of every conversation in every task of every trial, so this
# key is billed per run. The policy model itself is served locally by vLLM and
# needs no key.
#
# Hold the user-simulator model FIXED across the baseline run and every trained
# checkpoint. It is part of the benchmark, not part of the thing being measured.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Alternative: point --user-llm at an Anthropic model instead of the OpenAI
# default. tau2 calls litellm, so "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5" or
# "anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5" work as-is with this key set. Note that tau2's
# published leaderboard numbers use the gpt-4.1 default, so a run on a different
# simulator is internally valid but not comparable to those.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
